We are looking for a Full Stack developer to help us deliver complex ecosystems & products for a global customer. In this position, you will need advanced and/or fluent proficiency in English to communicate with different teams distributed globally during the workday.

We are looking for someone who:
- Has solid knowledge of Node.js, TypeScript, and Nest.js;

- Has experience with Next.js;

• Has knowledge of cloud platforms, preferably Azure;
- Is familiar with Terraform for infrastructure as code;
- Has experience with GitHub for CI/CD, including GitHub Actions and Runners;
- Has strong communication skills in English;
- Is interested in working in a dynamic team;
- Understands event-driven processing;
- Is enthusiastic about working with new technologies;
- Has the ability to leverage AI tools in their daily tasks.

Your responsibilities will include:
- Building high-quality software while considering functional and non-functional requirements;
- Collaborating with the team and client to solve real business challenges;
- Working within international, high-performance teams;
- Engaging in code reviews and providing constructive feedback to other developers;
- Innovating and thinking of solutions with the team for the projects you will work on.

You will stand out if you:
- Have knowledge of Agile development methodologies;

- Possess a good product vision;

• Are passionate about continuous learning and adapting to new technologies.

If you like it, just apply and good luck!

